<!-- Kati's own file, not generated by mob_new.

     Only what the launcher draws before Kati's own BEAM-driven UI (and its
     real Gettext catalogue) has any say: the widget picker's description, and
     the widget's empty state for a widget placed before Kati has ever written
     kati_widget.json. Once it has, the empty state's words come from the
     snapshot, translated on the Elixir side into the language chosen INSIDE
     Kati — which the launcher cannot know. The empty strings are the same
     msgids as Kati's catalogue ("Nothing queued", "Add a title"), and
     values-fa/strings.xml carries the same Persian. Every other string in Kati
     is Elixir's. -->
